 two optional methods for fetching"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"data, one based on tile coordinates, and one based on a bounding box. Classes that implement this"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"protocol must implement one, and only one of the methods. Methods on this protocol will not be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"called on main thread, they will be called on the caller’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"requestQueue"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre":{"kind":"symbol","title":"MapLibre","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Powerful, free and open-source mapping toolkit with full control over data sources and styling."}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre","role":"collection"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNComputedShapeSource/initWithIdentifier:dataSource:options:":{"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"initWithIdentifier:dataSource:options:","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"initWithIdentifier:dataSource:options:","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlncomputedshapesource\/initwithidentifier:datasource:options:","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNComputedShapeSource\/initWithIdentifier:dataSource:options:","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Returns a custom shape data source initialized with an identifier, data source, and a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"dictionary of options for the source according to the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"style"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"specification"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNShapeSourceOptionClipsCoordinates":{"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnshapesourceoptionclipscoordinates","title":"MLN